Reverse a linklist.
Everytime in loop just make head.next points to prevHead, and then move all these three pointers to one next step.
class Solution {
    public ListNode reverseList(ListNode head) {
        ListNode prev= null;
        ListNode curr = head;
        ListNode next = head;
        while(curr!=null){
            curr.next=prev;
            next=next.next;
            prev=curr;
            curr=next;
        }
        return prev;
    }
}


